      "type": "text",
      "key": "regex",
      "label": "Regex",
      "reason": "ValidationProperties.jsx:39 checks `item.itemType !== 'text'` to skip regex for text columns, but `item` (the column object) has no `itemType` property - the real field is `columnType`, and the switch's own `itemType` argument is never checked. So `item.itemType` is always undefined, the condition is always true, and Regex is shown for 'text' columns too. adapters/TextColumnAdapter.jsx:29-34 only wires minLength/maxLength/customRule into validateWidget - regex is never read for 'text', so the field does nothing."
    },
    {
      "type": "datepicker",
      "key": "timeFormat",
      "label": "Time Format",
